      "title": "Santa Muerte in the Inquisition files",
      "date_start": "1793",
      "date_end": "1797",
      "date_label": "1793 (Querétaro) and 1797 (San Luis de la Paz)",
      "category": "Mexican folklore, folk religion and the uncanny, as attested before and during the 1930s",
