      "uncertainties": "Confidence: High that the pamphlet prints this; the first edition's date (often given as 1871) UNVERIFIED this session.",
      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — The region's classic witch case — silver, a shapechanger, a wounded old woman — sits a ferry ride from Detroit. A 1930s rum-runner's family on the Snye whose grandmother still has a crooked arm.",
