      "id": "R23-028",
      "title": "The Deutsche Gesellschaft von Chicago — the immigrants' aid society, and the year 41,635 Germans landed",
      "date_start": "1853",
      "date_end": "1939",
      "date_label": "1853/54 to the 1930s",
      "category": "Imperial Germany in Chicago and the Midwest, 1871–1917: the template for a victor's presence in the 1930s",
