          "geography": "Morgan County, west-central Illinois — the state's first asylum (Kirkbride plan, five and a half storeys, opened 1851; first patient Sophronia McElhiney of McLe",
          "precision": "search locator, not surveyed",
          "map_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Jacksonville%2C%20Morgan%20County%2C%20west-central%20Illinois%20%E2%80%94%20the%20state%27s%20first%20asylum"
