      "title": "1. \"Green gold\": the henequen boom and the Casta Divina",
      "date_start": "1870",
      "date_end": "1920",
      "date_label": "c. 1870s–1920",
      "category": "Mexico's unceded south, 1900–1940: Yucatán, Quintana Roo, Chiapas, Oaxaca, Tabasco, Campeche",
