      "date_start": "1871-05-29",
      "date_end": "1871-05-29",
      "date_label": "29 May 1871 (living memory for the old; the founding myth for the clubs)",
      "category": "Imperial Germany in Chicago and the Midwest, 1871–1917: the template for a victor's presence in the 1930s",
