      "uncertainties": "Confidence: Medium. The Wikipedia article's early chapters draw heavily on Holmdahl's own interviews and memoirs (a 1913 interview is cited) and the article itself notes \"much of his personal actions during this time are unknown, as no written sources exist\" and carries several [citation needed] marks. Treat the outline as his story.",
      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — the pattern of a Guild lifer: begins at fifteen, changes flags eight times, owns nothing. The Holmdahl file is also the best single character-generator for the Guild's \"solitary hunter\" era — the man who reached the age of thirty having been paid by five governments.",
