      "title": "Vic Shaw and Mary Hastings — the Levee's madams: a dead heir, a frame-up, and a flight to Toronto",
      "date_start": "1890",
      "date_end": "1911",
      "date_label": "1890s–1911 (living memory; cross-ref R16 \"The Everleigh Club and the Levee\")",
      "category": "Women of 1930s Chicago and the Great Lakes",
