      "title": "The Poor Clare Colettines at 53rd and Laflin — an enclosed monastery founded from Cleveland (1893)",
      "date_start": "1893",
      "date_end": "1893",
      "date_label": "1893",
      "category": "Catholic Chicago in the 1930s: the ground a secret Church order (IHS) would stand on",
