      "title": "The O'Connor \"layover\" system: a city that sold sanctuary",
      "date_start": "1900",
      "date_end": "1935",
      "date_label": "1900–1935",
      "category": "The outlaw era in the Midwest: bank robbers, kidnappers, jailbreaks and manhunts, 1930–1936",
