      "id": "R23-002",
      "title": "The Kaiser's thanks — Red Eagles and Crown Orders handed out at the consulate in the Schiller Building",
      "date_start": "1902-08-29",
      "date_end": "1902-08-29",
      "date_label": "29 August 1902",
      "category": "Imperial Germany in Chicago and the Midwest, 1871–1917: the template for a victor's presence in the 1930s",
