      "title": "The Countess Gizycka — Cissy Patterson, the Tribune's daughter, and the child taken to a convent",
      "date_start": "1904",
      "date_end": "1930",
      "date_label": "1904–1930",
      "category": "Society Chicago: the rich at play, at home and in trouble (1925–1939)",
