          "geography": "Yucatán (the Cenote Sagrado — about 60 m across, cliffs of ~27 m to the water, joined to the site by a ~300 m sacbe)",
          "precision": "search locator, not surveyed",
          "map_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Chich%C3%A9n%20Itz%C3%A1%2C%20Yucat%C3%A1n%2C%20Chicago"
