      "title": "Fingerprints replace Bertillon in Chicago",
      "date_start": "1905-01-01",
      "date_end": "1911",
      "date_label": "1 Jan 1905, first conviction upheld 1910–11",
      "category": "Science, forensics, medicine, radio & media, weather & disasters: Chicago and the Great Lakes, 1929–1939",
