      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — copper is the war metal (shell casings, cartridge brass, wire). A Cananea widow's son in a Chicago packinghouse; a PLM organiser's file in Section 13's basement; and an Arizona Rangers roll that lists the 275. Three layers: the period called it a riot; the miners called it a massacre; the files ask who paid for the telegram.",
