      "synopsis": "Zemurray's Cuyamel Fruit Company stood to lose if Honduras's President Dávila enforced debt terms tied to a U.S. bank loan; Secretary of State Philander Knox rejected his appeals. So he bought a ship (the Hornet), had Lee Christmas recruit about 100 mercenaries in New Orleans (Sam Dreben among them), and chose the man to install: Bonilla.",
