      "title": "20. Río Bec B — the temple \"lost for 60 years\" that locals never lost",
      "date_start": "1912",
      "date_end": "1973",
      "date_label": "1912; the 1930s model; 1973",
      "category": "Mexico's unceded south, 1900–1940: Yucatán, Quintana Roo, Chiapas, Oaxaca, Tabasco, Campeche",
