      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — Oriente is where the setting's never-leaving Marines sit after 1917 (next Part) — on ground where, five years earlier, Marines guarded the mills while thousands of Black Cubans were hunted in the hills. The dead of 1912 are the region's ghosts, and they are not the monsters: a hook where the haunting is the evidence, and the thing hunting the investigators is whoever wants 1912 to stay unwritten.",
