      "uncertainties": "Confidence: High on the outline; exact dates of Carranza's stay and Diéguez's action not confirmed (Wikipedia gives none).",
      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — the capital of a movement that won and then lost its own state. A cathedral finished \"at the beginning of the 20th century\" over a Neogothic-Neoclassical plan is a dedicated building for a module: the IHS restored the church the revolution's governors banished the priests from (Calles, 1915).",
