      "title": "Mary Bartelme — \"Suitcase Mary\" of the Juvenile Court — assistant judge 1913, elected 1923, presiding judge 1927–June 1933",
      "date_start": "1913",
      "date_end": "1933-06",
      "date_label": "1913 – Jun 1933",
      "category": "Women of 1930s Chicago and the Great Lakes",
