      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — a Mexican archbishop's Chicago years — whose house did he live in, and did he meet Mundelein's IHS men? A letter in the Chicago chancery (R35, 719 N. Wabash) from Morelia's exile is the thread tying the two books together.",
