      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — for a player: a Veracruz medal is a conversation-stopper that is also a joke among the men who were there. A veteran character who holds one can open a door with it and be despised for it in the same room. A GM can seed a Golden Circle recruiter who collects Veracruz men because they were decorated for nothing and know it.",
