      "divergence": "The Fatherland (1914–16) happened. BENDS after: with no American war with Germany there is no 1919 disgrace and no Nazi phase; Viereck is simply the victor's man in New York, respectable, a guest at the German embassy, and his franking scheme is a Kaiserreich operation. M10's inversion stands: in the setting Germany wants Britain to sell America its islands, so Berlin's man campaigns for \"islands for debts\" with Berlin's full blessing — Britain pays Germany in cash raised from Washington.",
