      "divergence": "1914 happened. Butler's later career BENDS: with no American entry into the Great War, he spends 1916–17 in the Southern War and the Caribbean instead of France, and the enclave he \"made safe\" in 1914 is one America actually keeps. His 1934 \"Business Plot\" testimony and 1935 speeches are domestic-calendar events that can stand — his target in the setting's 1935 is the Tampico enclave and the Veracruz receivership by name.",
