      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — the Golden Circle's \"map\" includes the Pacific coast; a licensed-vice republic on the border with LA money behind it is exactly what the Circle would buy. Chandler (LA Times, Colorado River Land Co.) is a real name with a real stake and a documented Mexicali empire — a natural Circle-adjacent figure (proposal, not fact).",
