      "uncertainties": "Confidence: Medium (acreage from a secondary article; the \"at will\" line from a search summary).",
      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — Peláez's guards as the Golden Circle's native auxiliary (M01's proposal) — the setting's \"cult versus population\": a few hundred armed men, a whole region of ordinary villagers paying for them.",
