      "uncertainties": "Confidence: High on service and death; Medium on the Chicago birth (search summary only — confirm before print).",
      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — for a player: Chicago's first dead of the European war — a Gold Coast family's son in a Legion grave. A PC who served in his section brings a letter home to Prairie Avenue that the family has been waiting twenty years to read.",
