      "divergence": "BENDS. His 1917–18 Mexico mission is aimed at an America at war with Germany — which the setting's America never is. In the setting a German sabotage cell in Mexico City in 1917 is aimed at the American army in the ceded north and Tampico — the Southern War, not the Western Front. The death sentence was a wartime military tribunal; with no war with Germany he is a civil spy case, and the President who commutes him is Marshall, not Wilson; the one who frees him in 1923 is Wood, not Coolidge (Coolidge never president in the setting).",
