      "title": "Parral — the schoolteacher, the flag and the Mauser",
      "date_start": "1916-04-12",
      "date_end": "1916-04-12",
      "date_label": "12 April 1916",
      "category": "The Southern War's real soldiers, and the volunteers who went to Europe (1914–1917)",
