      "title": "The 1916 Mesabi strike: eight thousand miners, the IWW and three dead",
      "date_start": "1916-06-02",
      "date_end": "1916-09-17",
      "date_label": "2 June – 17 September 1916 (living memory, and the year of the break)",
      "category": "The Twin Cities, Duluth, the Iron Range and the Northwoods, 1920–1940, and their communities",
