      "divergence": "BENDS entirely — none of this happens. Survives: nothing of the regime; everything it destroyed. The setting's 1930s Chicago has its German Hospital, Germania Club, Bismarck Hotel and Gardens, Lubeck Street, two German dailies, German in 112 schools, a German-speaking Turnerbund, an intact Alliance — and no APL card index. (And no Red Scare either, per the BRIEF: the Palmer raids never happen, so the APL's afterlife is gone too.)",
