      "title": "Colonel Charles Young of Wilberforce — the horseback ride to prove he could serve (June 1918) (BENDS)",
      "date_start": "1918-06",
      "date_end": "1918-06",
      "date_label": "Jun 1918",
      "category": "Ohio beyond Cleveland and Toledo, 1920–1940: the cities and their communities",
