      "divergence": "BENDS — the real Americanization drive was supercharged by the 1917–18 war and the Red Scare; with no war against Germany and no Red Scare in the setting, \"100% Americanism\" is weaker and the hyphen survives: the setting's character categories (Irish, German, Polish, \"no hyphen\") are exactly what a world without the wartime campaign would keep. Addams's pacifism looks prophetic, not disloyal.",
