      "title": "The Rockefeller mosquito war",
      "date_start": "1920",
      "date_end": "1923",
      "date_label": "Veracruz, 1920 – 1923",
      "category": "Tampico and Veracruz, 1900–1940: the setting's two enclaves, in depth",
