      "title": "Daniel Hoan's Milwaukee — baby bonds, a debt-free city and the Time cover",
      "date_start": "1920",
      "date_end": "1940",
      "date_label": "1920–1940 (deepens R07)",
      "category": "Milwaukee 1925–1940: the most German city in America, in a world where Germany won",
