      "uncertainties": "Confidence: Medium-High (one detailed page plus a second confirming the raid and a wider arrest range).",
      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — Keep the arrests and Darrow, change the cause: an FBI Section 13 (or Bureau) sweep of Swedish lodges in Rockford looking for something the lodges were hiding, with the socialists as the cover story. The 186 files still exist in a federal cabinet somewhere.",
