      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — The one documented Chicago attempt to raise the dead — by a Black Hand gang with doctors and a pulmotor. The Golden Circle's Black Hand thread has a literal necromancy story from the record, fifteen years old in 1936, told by every old deputy at the county jail.",
