      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — Two Black aviators fighting each other in Addis Ababa in August 1935 is a real duel; a Chicago pilot who saw what the Italians dropped on Adwa is the Hunter Guild's kind of witness. And Harlem Airport in Oak Lawn is a private airstrip an hour from the Loop that nobody official watches.",
