      "id": "R39-021",
      "title": "St. Paul after O'Connor: the chiefs who kept the layover, and the kidnappings that broke it",
      "date_start": "1922",
      "date_end": "1936",
      "date_label": "1922–1936",
      "category": "The Twin Cities, Duluth, the Iron Range and the Northwoods, 1920–1940, and their communities",
