      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — A vice boss's son dies on the day the whole city stands watching a scoreboard — a ritual-shaped public killing. The old Looney gang's survivors are Joliet ex-convicts in 1930: Drost lived till 1939 and \"could not read\" — a witness who knew where the blackmail files went.",
