      "date_start": "1923",
      "date_end": "1935",
      "date_label": "land bought 1923, built 1931–35 (already in the setting: IHS's American seat)",
      "category": "Religion, churchmen, relics, revivals, new religions, cults, spiritualists and occultists (Chicago & the Great Lakes, 1925–1939)",
