      "uncertainties": "Confidence: High for dates; the Grasselli Tower and the university's seismograph station are well known but UNVERIFIED this session.",
      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — The order moves house in the middle of the decade: from 1931 to 1935 the IHS seat is split between an old West Side building and a half-built Gothic campus — the years when the order's archive was most exposed. What went missing in the move? (Cleveland's 1935 Eucharistic Congress, above, is the order's housewarming.)",
