      "divergence": "BENDS hard — VERACRUZ. De la Huerta, Obregón and Calles are all Sonorans from the ceded north (M01's key finding) — their careers must be re-derived. But the shape survives beautifully: a rebel general seizing Veracruz means seizing a port whose customs house is American. The receivership's Marines either hand the revenue to the rebels, or hold the customs house as an island in a rebel city. Flag for the owner.",
