      "id": "R41-010",
      "title": "\"Middletown\": the Lynds' Muncie, the X family, and the town that stayed the same",
      "date_start": "1924",
      "date_end": "1937",
      "date_label": "1924–25, 1929, 1935, 1937",
      "category": "Indiana and Michigan beyond Chicago and Detroit, 1920–1940: the cities and their communities",
