      "title": "Maurine Watkins and Chicago — the girl reporter who wrote the play",
      "date_start": "1924",
      "date_end": "1942",
      "date_label": "1924 / 30 December 1926 / films 1927 and 1942 (living memory; cross-ref R06 \"Beulah Annan and Murderess Row\")",
