          "map_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Milford%20Mine%2C%20about%20five%20miles%20north%20of%20Crosby%2C%20on%20the%20Cuyuna%20Range%2C%20Crow%20Wing%20County%2C%20Minnesota"
