      "uncertainties": "Confidence: High on the date, the seizure and the padlock; Medium on the number of buildings (Ramírez, via Wikipedia). • On 21 February 1925 about a hundred men (unverified — V_M16), backed by the CROM labour federation, seized La Soledad from its pastor (Father Silva, per TIME) and installed the ex-priest …",
