      "id": "R41-040",
      "title": "Eden Springs Park and the bearded ball club: the House of David after Purnell",
      "date_start": "1926",
      "date_end": "1939",
      "date_label": "Benton Harbor, 1926–1930s",
      "category": "Indiana and Michigan beyond Chicago and Detroit, 1920–1940: the cities and their communities",
