      "title": "12. The Mason–Spinden expedition — the New York Times goes east, January–May 1926",
      "date_start": "1926-01",
      "date_end": "1926-05",
      "date_label": "Jan 1926 – May 1926",
      "category": "Mexico's unceded south, 1900–1940: Yucatán, Quintana Roo, Chiapas, Oaxaca, Tabasco, Campeche",
