      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — the Knights as the IHS's public face — a legitimate fraternal order whose Mexican Fund moved money through every parish; the IHS can bury a payment in five million leaflets. The Golden Circle, which also dresses as a fraternal order, would recognise the method.",
