      "title": "Barnes-Hecker: the mine that drank a lake",
      "date_start": "1926-11-03",
      "date_end": "1926-11-03",
      "date_label": "Ishpeming, 3 November 1926 (living memory)",
      "category": "Indiana and Michigan beyond Chicago and Detroit, 1920–1940: the cities and their communities",
