      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — Three layers made easy: the period's reading (a devotional pamphlet, 1935), the folklore (a family curse passed from father and aunt), what is there (a summoner's bargain the family made in Milwaukee). Riesinger is exactly the Capuchin IHS would keep on call in Wisconsin.",
