          "name": "Villahermosa",
          "address": "",
          "geography": "(then still often called by its full \"San Juan Bautista\"), Tabasco — the cathedral church of the Lord of Esquipulas, built 1776 to house a black Christ donated ",
          "precision": "search locator, not surveyed",
          "map_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Villahermosa%20%2C%20Tabasco%20%E2%80%94%20the%20cathedral%20church%20of%20the%20Lord%20of%20Esquipulas%2C%20built%201776%20to%20house%20a%20black%20Christ%20donated%20on%2018%20March%201774%20by%20the%20Bishop%20of%20Yucat%C3%A1n%2C%20D"
