      "uncertainties": "Confidence: High. • The Swedish-American press baron gave away his million-dollar castle in 1929 — the year of the crash — and, per one summary, the family had lived in an apartment above the newspaper downtown, so it is unclear how much time they spent in the mansion (unverified — V_R39: the Wikipedia article is silent on an apartment).",
