      "id": "R41-015",
      "title": "Lincoln Tower, the Manship Lincoln and a bank-robbery first: Fort Wayne in the Depression",
      "date_start": "1930",
      "date_end": "1937",
      "date_label": "1930–1937",
      "category": "Indiana and Michigan beyond Chicago and Detroit, 1920–1940: the cities and their communities",
