      "title": "Bachelor's Grove — a cemetery in the woods, mostly forgotten by the 1930s",
      "date_start": "1930",
      "date_end": "1939",
      "date_label": "1930 – 1939",
      "category": "Chicago's oddities: the rich and their scandals, strange collections, hidden and haunted places, legends, curiosities and trivia (1925–1939, plus living memory)",
