      "uncertainties": "Confidence: High.",
      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — The perfect \"science\" door for a Secret Service team: Keeler's polygraph gives a flat line on one suspect — no pulse change, no breath change, nothing. Goddard keeps a drawer of bullets that match no gun on earth.",
