          "map_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Black%20Bottom%3A%20Brush%20Street%20on%20the%20west%2C%20the%20Grand%20Trunk%20tracks%20on%20the%20east%2C%20the%20river%20on%20the%20south%2C%20cut%20by%20Gratiot%20Avenue%2C%20Chicago"
