      "title": "St. John Cantius — the Polish baroque church whose famous relic room is later than the 1930s",
      "date_start": "1930",
      "date_end": "1939",
      "date_label": "1930 – 1939",
      "category": "Catholic Chicago in the 1930s: the ground a secret Church order (IHS) would stand on",
