      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — Handle with care: the real case is a sad story of two exploited Seneca women and a philandering museum artist. The usable layer is the press's own framing — \"modern police dealt with primitive belief\" — and the question it never asked: who taught a Buffalo sculptor's circle to use a ouija board?",
