      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — this is the owner's method ready-made — a real date, a real shop, a real name. The setting's layer: the \"French magician\" of the folk tale is a real foreigner who came through Chihuahua in 1930, and what he did in the window at night was not dancing. (Vampires in high society, provincial branch.)",
