      "title": "G. K. Chesterton at Notre Dame",
      "date_start": "1930-10-04",
      "date_end": "1930-11",
      "date_label": "4 October to mid-November 1930 (ring, South Bend)",
      "category": "Who came to Chicago, 1925–1940: royalty, heads of state, statesmen, scientists, churchmen, celebrities and notorious visitors",
