      "title": "The Lee house: 4,000 people on a lawn in south Minneapolis",
      "date_start": "1931-07-11",
      "date_end": "1931-07-11",
      "date_label": "11 July 1931 (and the two years after)",
      "category": "The Twin Cities, Duluth, the Iron Range and the Northwoods, 1920–1940, and their communities",
