      "uncertainties": "Confidence: High. • great-great-grandson of the Declaration's Roger Sherman), corporate lawyer for Bucyrus-Erie in South Milwaukee and Marquette engineering lecturer (unverified — V_R27), whose Radio Man ran in Argosy from June 1924; • Heading: (unverified — V_R27)",
