      "title": "The milk strikes of 1933 — bayonets at Durham Hill, a farmer dead on the Grafton road, seven creameries dynamited",
      "date_start": "1933",
      "date_end": "1933",
      "date_label": "1933",
      "category": "Milwaukee 1925–1940: the most German city in America, in a world where Germany won",
