      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — The cabin is the fair's one honest ghost-house: du Sable's own hearth, rebuilt by women the fair tried to keep out. The period reads a curiosity; the folklore is the founder's spirit; what's there is a threshold the Golden Circle's Chicago men will not cross.",
