      "title": "Cincinnati Union Terminal — the Art Deco cathedral of the rails, opened March 1933",
      "date_start": "1933-03",
      "date_end": "1933-03",
      "date_label": "Mar 1933",
      "category": "Ohio beyond Cleveland and Toledo, 1920–1940: the cities and their communities",
