      "title": "The teachers take City Hall and the Board",
      "date_start": "1933-03-17",
      "date_end": "1933-03-17",
      "date_label": "17–22 March 1933",
      "category": "Depression Chicago: money, politics, labor, protest, hunger, and the city's institutions breaking (1929–1939)",
