      "title": "Repeal comes to Chicago",
      "date_start": "1933-04-07",
      "date_end": "1933-12-05",
      "date_label": "April 7, 1933 (3.2 beer) and December 5, 1933 (full repeal)",
      "category": "The Outfit and gangland Chicago, 1929–1939",
