      "title": "The parole petition, the Mooresville visit the agents watched, and \"Public Enemy Number One\"",
      "date_start": "1933-05",
      "date_end": "1934-06-22",
      "date_label": "May 1933 / 5–8 April / 22 June 1934",
      "category": "The outlaw era in the Midwest: bank robbers, kidnappers, jailbreaks and manhunts, 1930–1936",
