      "uncertainties": "Confidence: High on the dates and the PE1 speech; Medium on the judge's signature (standard account, not on the pages read). • The agents watched the family dinner through the trees (unverified — V2_R02) and let it finish (the pages read: agents cruising nearby saw him but did not recognise him).",
