      "uncertainties": "Confidence: Low-Medium (blog-grade sources; timeline conflicts). • The History Press article calls her \"a 34-year-old woman from Chicago\" — so R28's \"Chicago/Michigan-born\" is UNVERIFIED, and this looks like a New York case with a possible Midwest family tie.",
      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — A locked-room disappearance on a liner: a rich professional woman, a phoney Balkan officer, a porthole. A missing-persons file marked \"Unfound\" for the Secret Service's old guard.",
