      "divergence": "BENDS. The real killing came after the Marines left, with the Guardia acting alone and the U.S. Minister appalled. In the setting the Marines are still there — so either the killing is Marine-sanctioned (and Lane's cables would be a cover) or the Guardia does it in the shadow of a garrison that cannot claim ignorance. Open, for the owner.",
