      "id": "R02-054",
      "title": "Cummings's \"war on crime\": the Bureau gets guns, arrest powers and a federal bank-robbery law",
      "date_start": "1934-05",
      "date_end": "1934-06",
      "date_label": "May–June 1934",
      "category": "The outlaw era in the Midwest: bank robbers, kidnappers, jailbreaks and manhunts, 1930–1936",
