      "title": "The Progressive Party is born in Fond du Lac",
      "date_start": "1934-05-19",
      "date_end": "1934-05-19",
      "date_label": "19 May 1934 (Madison and the La Follettes)",
      "category": "Wisconsin beyond Milwaukee, 1920–1940: the cities and their communities",
