      "title": "The whaleback Henry Cort on the Muskegon breakwater; the Escanaba's rescue; a Coast Guardsman lost",
      "date_start": "1934-11-30",
      "date_end": "1934-11-30",
      "date_label": "30 November 1934",
      "category": "The lakes themselves, 1925–1940: ships, sailors, wrecks, storms, lighthouses, the Coast Guard, smugglers and the lake economy",
