      "title": "Helen Richey — the first woman airline pilot flies Washington–Detroit for ten months",
      "date_start": "1934-12-31",
      "date_end": "1935",
      "date_label": "31 December 1934 to 1935",
      "category": "Women of 1930s Chicago and the Great Lakes",
