      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — The owner asked for \"churches getting destroyed.\" The cathedral of the ring's German archdiocese burns in the dead of winter 1935, two years before the setting's alpha; IHS would want to know what was in the sacristy safe and whether the fire started at the altar.",
