      "title": "The Chicago Drake trial: 43 indicted, 8 convicted",
      "date_start": "1935-05",
      "date_end": "1936-02",
      "date_label": "May 1935 to February 1936",
      "category": "Counterfeiters, forgers, con men, swindlers and the Secret Service's real work (Chicago & the Midwest, 1925–1940)",
