      "divergence": "BENDS — the whole 1938–39 fight was framed as Communists versus anti-Communists (Martin testified to the Dies Committee on 1 December 1938 that nearly every auto strike of the past two years was Communist-instigated). With no Soviet Union, the factions need new labels: Socialists versus Catholics, \"Germans\" versus \"Americans\", or the IWW's heirs versus the AFL.",
