      "divergence": "BENDS. \"German embassy support\" in the setting means Imperial Germany — \"Germany as the patron of other people's revolutions\" exactly — but there is no Nazi model to imitate; the Gold Shirts become a Mexican nationalist-revanchist militia with German money, whose natural target is the American occupier and the \"foreigners\" in the rump state. The name \"Gold Shirts\" is from Villa's Dorados (his elite cavalry). UNCEDED MEXICO.",
