      "title": "Walter Liggett machine-gunned in a Minneapolis alley",
      "date_start": "1935-12-09",
      "date_end": "1935-12-09",
      "date_label": "9 Dec 1935",
      "category": "Murder, madness and disappearances: Chicago and the Great Lakes, 1925–1940",
