      "summary": "[kicker only] \"Numbered\" — Indianapolis Times, p1 — Detroit: exactly 11 1/2 years ago a young couple who laughed at superstition were married in \"Cell 13\" of a British-built convict prison; the same day (Friday the 13th) another wire item reads \"She's All 13's\" — Chicago's Shirley Jansen, with 13 letters in her name, turns 13 with a cake with 13 candles —",
