      "title": "Father Coughlin's Cleveland rallies",
      "date_start": "1936-05-11",
      "date_end": "1936-08-16",
      "date_label": "11 May and 16 August 1936 (ring; extends R05)",
      "category": "Who came to Chicago, 1925–1940: royalty, heads of state, statesmen, scientists, churchmen, celebrities and notorious visitors",
