      "title": "The Black Legion in Detroit and the murder of Charles Poole",
      "date_start": "1936-05-12",
      "date_end": "1936-05-12",
      "date_label": "12–13 May 1936",
      "category": "The Great Lakes ring beyond Chicago, 1929–1939",
