      "divergence": "BENDS — America never entered the Great War in the setting, so there are no 1917–19 \"World War veterans\" to pay. A bonus in 1936 would go to veterans of the Southern War (Mexico, 1916–17) and the occupations, a smaller and different body of men. (The 1932 Bonus Army bends the same way.)",
