      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — As R05 says: an IHS inspection under cover of a tour. Add the detail that the plane was chartered — its crew list, its refuelling stops (Cheyenne? Salt Lake?) and what was loaded at Chicago Municipal are all a GM's to invent.",
