      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — the owner chose this night for the real sky. The real sky was: clear (unverified — V_R24: inferred, not recorded) and cold, a bright gibbous moon in the south at dusk, dark after two. The next five nights were mild and wet (see 24–27 Dec) — the eclipse night's weather is the one thing the plot did not know.",
