      "divergence": "BENDS — erased or transformed. No Russian revolution (§31): no Bolshevik Trotsky, no Stalin, no exile, no ice axe. Tampico is the TAMPICO ENCLAVE — an American port. What survives: Tampico as the hemisphere's arrival point for Europe's political exiles and a Mexico that shelters foreign radicals. A setting equivalent could be a German-world exile — a Russian émigré of the defeated empire, a Polish or Irish revolutionary — landing on an oil tanker at an American-held port.",
