      "uncertainties": "Confidence: High on Allman/Prendergast/Lippert/dates; Medium on Lyons (his testimony is confirmed to exist and to have been contentious, but no page read gives its content — Lead) • Lawrence Lyons was one of the rank-and-file officers whose testimony \"sparked contentious exchanges\" (unverified — V_R17) (the Library of Congress holds Harris & Ewing photographs of both Allman and Lyons at the witness table — already listed in the owner's PD photo catalogue).",
      "hook": "Proposal, not canon — a Section 13 liaison sits behind Allman at the witness table. Section 13's interest is not the strike; it is the frame of film the committee did not show.",
