      "id": "R20-027",
      "title": "The LaSalle Street tunnel is closed and filled",
      "date_start": "1939-11-27",
      "date_end": "1939-11-27",
      "date_label": "27 Nov 1939 (the subway eats the old river tunnels)",
      "category": "The city's guts: power, water, gas, sewers, tunnels, bridges, digging, building and demolition (Chicago and the Great Lakes, 1925–1940)",
