      "id": "R17-024",
      "title": "The autopsy that went missing for fifty years — brown eyes, a kept brain, a lost fingerprint card",
      "date_start": "1934",
      "date_end": "1934",
      "date_label": "c. 1934 (inferred from entry text)",
      "category": "Deep dossiers on the owner's own seven Chicago mission seeds",
