      "id": "R43-028",
      "title": "Cedar Point in the Depression — the Hotel Breakers, the Coliseum and a state park that almost was",
      "date_start": "1935",
      "date_end": "1935",
      "date_label": "c. 1935 (inferred from entry text)",
      "category": "Ohio beyond Cleveland and Toledo, 1920–1940: the cities and their communities",
